<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed mixed in active trading.</p>
<p>The Amex Composite index closed at 607.73, down 1.29.</p>
<p>The average price per share fell $0.03.</p>
<p>Advancers beat decliners 274 to 272.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 18,945,135 compared with 22,503,165 on Tuesday.</p>
<p>(Prices official as of 1630 EST/2130 GMT)</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1881))</p>
</text>
